t exactly two positive real numbers \\( x \\), the only possible value of \\( k \\) is the average of the other three roots, which is \\( \\frac{188}{3} \\).\n\nTherefore, the sum of the three values of \\( k \\) is:\n\\[ \\boxed{188}. \\]",
